<h2>Month-End Close Checklist</h2>
<h3>Pre-Close (Last 2-3 Business Days of the Month)</h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Send close calendar and deadline reminders to all contributors</li>
