<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Complete preliminary bank reconciliation (all but last-day activity)</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Review open purchase orders for potential accrual needs</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Confirm payroll processing schedule aligns with close timeline</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled> Collect information for any known unusual transactions</li>
</ul>
